# With no planeswalker anywhere, Stingerquill Annex enters tapped (CR 614.1d) - the land itself is not a planeswalker - so it
# cannot be tapped for mana that turn (refused), and on Bot1's next turn it untaps and taps for {B}, one of its two colors.

[Bot1 Deck]
Stingerquill Annex
Island x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Stingerquill Annex.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Stingerquill Annex.Tapped = true
! Bot1.Battlefield.Stingerquill Annex.Activate(Color: Black)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
